✔ sendEmail stores the message and sends it at once; the row is marked sent (64.994208ms)
✔ a failing mailer does not throw: the message waits in the queue with attempt 1 and a 1-minute delay (1.520375ms)
✔ backoff is 1, 5, 15, 60, 240 minutes then 240 again, and the 8th failure marks the row failed (18.6975ms)
✔ when Gmail recovers, the worker sends what is due and not yet due mail waits (2.372292ms)
✔ the fast path and the worker never both send one row (4.303292ms)
✔ one-time-link mail loses its body as soon as it is sent (1.777333ms)
✔ a reservation and its confirmation are queued in the same transaction; the confirmation is sent and stamped (9.60325ms)
✔ a failure while STORING the confirmation never undoes the reservation (savepoint): the books stay held, nothing is queued, the order is flagged (3.817875ms)
✔ a failure loading the order lines while BUILDING the confirmation does not undo the reservation either; it is flagged for the admin (2.459291ms)
✔ if the commit itself fails, there is no reservation: no order, the book is back in stock, no confirmation queued or sent (3.150458ms)
✔ a rolled-back transaction leaves no outbox row (enqueue works inside the caller's transaction) (0.570417ms)
✔ with Gmail down at reservation time the order is reserved and its confirmation waits in the queue, then is sent and stamped by the worker (5.303542ms)
✔ when mail gives up, ONE alert per hour: kinds, counts, last error without personal data (15.2035ms)
✔ the failure alert is handed back (and retried next minute) when the alert mail itself fails (2.255667ms)
✔ retention: sent bodies are purged after 30 days, failed after 90, younger rows are untouched (5.878334ms)
✔ erasing an account erases its queued mail and cancels the pending ones (4.828542ms)
✔ admin outbox page lists the last rows with status and error, and is admin-only (35.7205ms)
✔ admin 'retry now' sends a failed row; 'mark failed as handled' clears the failed ones (7.435917ms)
✔ resend confirmation: queues and sends a fresh copy for a reserved order, refuses any other status, is admin-only (9.479167ms)
✔ the orders list offers 'Resend confirmation' for reservations, with a NOT SENT marker when the mail never went (7.318375ms)
✔ dashboard 'needs attention': a reservation with no confirmation after 30 minutes, and failed mail (29.593333ms)
✔ 'Send a test email' goes through the outbox and shows 'sent', or the exact SMTP error (13.703709ms)
✔ the order detail page offers Resend confirmation for a reservation (7.070875ms)
